Z||000003||pherder||03-29-2001||08:44 AM||||Been there, done that, WON'T do it again!<P>Hope you have the transaxle from a Q4 car.<P>The Fiero's transaxle will not bolt on.<P>Axles are the same.<P>Wiring can be a nightmare.<P>Plumbing is different between the Fiero years.<P>Exhaust is always a fun adventure.<P>Paul<BR>88 Coupe w/HO Quad 4<BR>||||reg||1
